{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"caa32532","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.004001,"end_time":"2026-11-10T00:13:32.626895+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-10T00:13:32.622894+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# Multi-Branch Version 3 — Open-Source Time-Series Stack (`tsai` + `tsaug` + `tsfel`/`tsfresh` + `NOOP`)\n","\n","This notebook modernises the CMI BFRB detection pipeline with open-source libraries while retaining custom competition logic and `cr7_kimmitch` (NOOP) sensor analytics:\n","- **Data Augmentation (`tsaug`)**: Time-warping, cropping, multiplicative drift, jitter, relative noise, time-shifting, temporal masking, channel drop, and modality dropout (`thm`/`tof`).\n","- **Feature Extraction (`tsfel` / `tsfresh` + retained `NOOP` + `cr7_kimmitch`)**: Sample-rate adaptive extraction across IMU (`100 Hz`) and Thermopile/ToF (`20 Hz`), retaining all legacy NOOP features plus `cr7_kimmitch` descriptors (`posture_var`, `motion_cv`, `jerk_floor`, `acc_gyro_coupling`, `dog_var`, `baevsky_si`, `acf_kimmitch`, `peakedness`, and `thm`/`tof` power-branch drift/spread/CV).\n","- **Network Architecture (`tsai`)**: Multimodal branches for IMU, Thermopile, and 5×8×8 spatial ToF grids using the simplest `'Conv1d'` backbone (or `tsai` backbones) with a compact range of architecture sizes.\n","- **Competition Scorer & 50% Hidden-Test Simulation**: Exact `(binary_f1 + gesture_f1) / 2` metric evaluated on both the normal holdout set and the simulated hidden test set with `thm_*` and `tof_*` nullified for 50% of sequences.\n","- **Separate Search Spaces**: Edit `BEST_PARAMS`, `GRID_PARAM_SPACE`, `BAYESIAN_PARAM_SPACE`, or `EVOLUTIONARY_PARAM_SPACE` in their own dedicated cells under `# Params` with zero `.update()` calls.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"id":"1978d612","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-10T00:13:32.635331Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-10T00:13:32.634744Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-